      "message": "More general question - have you checked [the Zephyr LED driver](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/include/zephyr/drivers/led.h#L137)? Probably [the PWM one](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/drivers/led/led_pwm.c). Can we use it?",
