      "writtenOn": "2026-05-12T14:42:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the beginning there was a requirement to blink a custom number of times with custom on/off brightness and those drivers seemed to be not sufficient. Now implementation is simplified but I do not see benefit of using them. Maybe if we had more leds...",
