      "writtenOn": "2026-05-13T08:01:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are classic benefits of using upstream like more tested code, easier maintenance etc. But I can see also 1 additional feature that is not added here - the per-device power management. It could be used in both cases - once we suspend entire system and for the runtime suspend once we want to turn-off the led.",
